  "scope": "Complete diff of 28 Python test files and 27 source/tool/probe files, plus 241-occurrence disposition ledger. No other uncommitted or future changes approved.",
  "conclusion": "No blocking semantic regression found in the reviewed source/test changes. Safe to integrate for final combined verification; not release-ready until source-bound manifests/receipts are independently renewed on the frozen final tree and all gates pass.",
  "semanticReview": [
    {
      "area": "SDK casts, TypeGuards and overloads",
      "finding": "typing.cast and type annotations do not convert runtime values. Cast sites remain behind explicit isinstance/type/callable/profile guards. KuCoin token runtime implementation is unchanged: nullable None returns None only when allowed; otherwise nonempty bounded token checks apply. Two overload declarations only describe existing return behavior."
    },
    {
      "area": "SDK/static methods and cancellation",
      "finding": "Converted adapter/test methods did not use self. Instance call argument order remains the same; async methods stay async. asyncio.CancelledError derives from BaseException in pinned Python3.12, so removing catch-and-reraise branches leaves cancellation escaping Exception handlers without clearing shared bootstrap caches or recording stream failures."
    },
    {
      "area": "Loop-bound callbacks",
      "finding": "Default arguments bind each iteration instance, response mutation and expected scenario while preserving body logic. Mutable clocks/counters remain shared within their original scenario; explicit partial captures the per-category parameter dictionary before a bounded read. No assertion is removed."
    },
    {
      "area": "CurrentRead next()",
      "finding": "Missing scope now raises IncompleteCurrentStateError(current_scope_unregistered), rather than leaking StopIteration/RuntimeError. Matching-scope page/complete mutation is unchanged. Failure does not mark a scope complete; added negative test verifies this. call still performs the budgeted read before scope lookup as before."
    },
    {
      "area": "Complexity extractions",
      "finding": "Manually reviewed _fill_timestamp, _rounded_boundary, _original_boundary, _retention_covers, _valid_continuation_token, _history_rows, _validate_request_integers, _assert_transport_text, optional order-value helpers, _remote_client and _validate_completion_verdict. Conditions, bounds, error messages and short-circuit order are preserved. Decimal precision180 remains local to rounding; original floor-buy/ceiling-sell arithmetic is retained."
    },
    {
      "area": "Boolean expressions and exception simplification",
      "finding": "Chained integer comparison is equivalent; KuCoin reduceOnly is already guarded exact bool before is True. Regex matches converted to explicit booleans retain success/failure behavior. UnicodeDecodeError and InventoryError remain covered by their existing ValueError superclass catches."
    },
    {
      "area": "Test contracts",
      "finding": "Nested context managers were flattened in the same entry/exit order. Decimal multiplication remains evaluated and context flags checked. Mock NOW patch now restores module state during unittest cleanup. Added probe assertions enforce headers dict/body None. AST inventory found every original assertion unchanged, plus five additional assertions."
    }
  ],
